#: {{zh-x|條 褲 啜 住 大髀，好 唔 舒服。|My trousers are '''sticking''' to my thighs; it's so uncomfortable.|C}}
#: {{zh-x|隻 戒指 太 細 喇，戴 嗰時 啜 實 手指。|The ring is too small. It gets stuck on my finger when I wear it.|C}}
